    "text": "Shown in the figure below is a meter-bridge set up with null deflection in the galvanometer. \n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/rA8Bb_aRR7cQwzxUtjcKaJHQmkW2x9tbXNN2GXNzp7E.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\nThe value of the unknown resistor $R$ is",
